Subject: [PATCH 1382/1695] dts: stm32: add OEM rproc encryption key for
 stm32mp23

Add new OTP entry for remoteproc encryption key.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 3f5023cce9a821f25fff73bed864caf13734a37e dts: stm32: add OEM rproc encryption key for stm32mp23]
